    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ab6fc64802452.99566964\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has revealed the Bonus Reward for completing the October 2026 Traveler's Log!<br><br>In today's WoW Weekly, Blizzard recapped the last week of World of Warcraft, while also revealing something new for the future. The October 2026 Trading Post's bonus reward is <a class=\"q1 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=278609/ensemble-thornshadow-assassins-attire\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Ensemble: Thornshadow Assassin's Attire\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/8026786.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Ensemble: Thornshadow Assassin's Attire</span></a>! <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303293.jpg\" id=\"1303293\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1303293.jpg?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Bonus Reward October 2026\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.90785 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/news/24303315\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><h2 id=\"dress-to-distress-with-costumed-calamity-in-october-s-trading-post\" class=\"heading-size-2 first\">Dress to Distress with Costumed Calamity in October’s Trading Post</h2><div class=\"\"><a href=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_entry_media/og/OGA0360880WY1790273229235.png\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image no-border\" src=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_entry_media/og/OGA0360880WY1790273229235.png\" alt=\"\"></a></div><div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>This Month's Bonus Reward: Thornshadow Assassin's Attire Transmog Set</b> <br><i>“For missions that don't officially exist.”</i></div>October’s Trading Post is cloaked in calamity, with fiendish finds ready to add chaos to your collection. Complete activities to earn Trader’s Tender, fill your Traveler’s Log, and slink into the shadows with the <b>Ensemble: Thornshadow Assassin's Attire</b>. <br><br>Visit T&amp;W (Tawney and Wilder) just outside the Mage District in Stormwind, or the Zen’shiri Trading Post next to Grommash Hold in Orgrimmar, to check out the latest items they have available. Players can also visit the Trading Post in the capital cities of Dornogal (The Foregrounds) on the Isle of Dorn and in the renewed <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24243213\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Silvermoon City</a>, where representatives of both Tawney and Wilder and the Zen’shiri Trading Post are open for business.<br><br>Champions new to or returning to <i>World of Warcraft</i> and <i>Midnight</i> can <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/news/24131507\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">tour the Trading Post</a> to learn everything you need to know, from where to find it to how you can earn additional Trader's Tender through the Traveler's Log. <br><br>The <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24295383\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">September Trading Post Outlet </a>closes soon! Get in your last purchases before the vendors change over to their October inventory.<hr></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has revealed the Bonus Reward for completing the October 2026 Traveler's Log!<br /><br />In today's WoW Weekly, Blizzard recapped the last week of World of Warcraft, while also revealing something new for the future. The October 2026 Trading Post's bonus reward is <a href=\"/item=278609/ensemble-thornshadow-assassins-attire\">Ensemble: Thornshadow Assassin's Attire</a>! <br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\"> Dress to Distress with Costumed Calamity in October’s Trading Post </h2> <br /><a href=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_entry_media/og/OGA0360880WY1790273229235.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a> <br /> <b>This Month's Bonus Reward: Thornshadow Assassin's Attire Transmog Set</b> <br /><i>“For missions that don't officially exist.”</i><br /><br />October’s Trading Post is cloaked in calamity, with fiendish finds ready to add chaos to your collection. Complete activities to earn Trader’s Tender, fill your Traveler’s Log, and slink into the shadows with the <b>Ensemble: Thornshadow Assassin's Attire</b>. <br /><br />Visit T&amp;W (Tawney and Wilder) just outside the Mage District in Stormwind, or the Zen’shiri Trading Post next to Grommash Hold in Orgrimmar, to check out the latest items they have available. Players can also visit the Trading Post in the capital cities of Dornogal (The Foregrounds) on the Isle of Dorn and in the renewed <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24243213\" rel=\"nofollow\">Silvermoon City</a>, where representatives of both Tawney and Wilder and the Zen’shiri Trading Post are open for business.<br /><br />Champions new to or returning to <i>World of Warcraft</i> and <i>Midnight</i> can <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/news/24131507\" rel=\"nofollow\">tour the Trading Post</a> to learn everything you need to know, from where to find it to how you can earn additional Trader's Tender through the Traveler's Log. <br /><br />The <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24295383\" rel=\"nofollow\">September Trading Post Outlet </a>closes soon! Get in your last purchases before the vendors change over to their October inventory. <br /></noscript>            \n        ",
