    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ab6fdccc9c8e6.93543286\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard is asking to hear from you! What topics would you like to hear developer insights on in future podcast episodes?<br><br><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/episode-1-of-the-world-of-warcraft-forever-podcast-now-live-383080\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Episode 1 of the WoW: Forever Podcast</a> recently debuted, and the planning for the next are already underway. With a focus on Class Design, many players are likely to be interested in what's upcoming for their favorite class and spec!<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2361993/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Greetings!<br><br>We’ve been super excited about the reception to our first episode of the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m49-jvGPCkA\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">WoW: Forever Podcast</a> and are already gearing up for next week’s show!<br><br>This next episode is going to focus heavily <b> Class Design </b> with special guests from our systems design team, so please look forward to that!<br><br>Looking forward past that, the team wanted to know if there are any other topics that you would like developer insights on for future episodes?<br><br>So, feel free to post and let us know what topics you’d like to see us dig into and discuss in the WoW: Forever Podcast!</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard is asking to hear from you! What topics would you like to hear developer insights on in future podcast episodes?<br /><br /><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/episode-1-of-the-world-of-warcraft-forever-podcast-now-live-383080\">Episode 1 of the WoW: Forever Podcast</a> recently debuted, and the planning for the next are already underway. With a focus on Class Design, many players are likely to be interested in what's upcoming for their favorite class and spec!<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">Greetings!<br /><br />We’ve been super excited about the reception to our first episode of the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m49-jvGPCkA\" rel=\"nofollow\">WoW: Forever Podcast</a> and are already gearing up for next week’s show!<br /><br />This next episode is going to focus heavily <b> Class Design </b> with special guests from our systems design team, so please look forward to that!<br /><br />Looking forward past that, the team wanted to know if there are any other topics that you would like developer insights on for future episodes?<br /><br />So, feel free to post and let us know what topics you’d like to see us dig into and discuss in the WoW: Forever Podcast!</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
