    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ab6fc021ad099.49457022\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\"><div class=\"box\" data-level=\"null\">Update 11:15pm PDT: Blizzard has stated that server restarts to fix these issues are now imminent, and the maintenance time should be short.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">To implement fixes that should address stability issues, we will shutdown and restart the Beta in the next few minutes.<br><br>The maintenance period should be very brief.</div></div></div>Blizzard has acknowledged issues with WoW: Forever servers that are affecting some players.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2361831/23\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">We’re tracking server issues that are affecting some Beta testers, and our fix for this will almost certainly result in restarting servers today.<br><br>Thank you for these reports.</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Update 11:15pm PDT: Blizzard has stated that server restarts to fix these issues are now imminent, and the maintenance time should be short.<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\"><br />To implement fixes that should address stability issues, we will shutdown and restart the Beta in the next few minutes.<br /><br />The maintenance period should be very brief.<br /></div></div><br /><br />Blizzard has acknowledged issues with WoW: Forever servers that are affecting some players.<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">We’re tracking server issues that are affecting some Beta testers, and our fix for this will almost certainly result in restarting servers today.<br /><br />Thank you for these reports.</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
